OL,3,GNEWSAHospitals make masks plea after
OL,4,Aincrease in flu
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn NHS trust is asking staff and
OL,7,Fmembers of the public to wear face
OL,8,Fmasks on its wards.
OL,10,FFrimley Health NHS Foundation Trust has
OL,11,Fadvised patients, visitors and staff to
OL,12,Fwear masks in clinical area from
OL,13,FFriday.
OL,15,FThe trust - which runs sites in Surrey,
OL,16,FHampshire and Berkshire, including
OL,17,FFrimley Park and Wexham Park hospitals
OL,18,F- also requested visitors with symptoms
OL,19,Fof a respiratory infection to stay
OL,20,Faway.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
